From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Codex <codex@local>
Date: Mon, 8 Jun 2026 19:06:00 -0700
Subject: [PATCH] stm32mp257-dk: do not start IWDG1 in BL2

IWDG1 is being migrated out of the secure-world watchdog service. Leave
the peripheral unstarted by TF-A so OP-TEE does not need to service it and
Linux can own the non-secure peripheral directly.

Signed-off-by: Codex <codex@local>
---
 fdts/stm32mp257f-dk.dts | 3 ++-
 1 file changed, 2 insertions(+), 1 deletion(-)

diff --git a/fdts/stm32mp257f-dk.dts b/fdts/stm32mp257f-dk.dts
index 7332bbfb02..8f9c6a1c0b 100644
--- a/fdts/stm32mp257f-dk.dts
+++ b/fdts/stm32mp257f-dk.dts
@@ -162,7 +162,8 @@
 
 &iwdg1 {
 	timeout-sec = <32>;
-	status = "okay";
+	status = "disabled";
+	/delete-property/ timeout-sec;
 };
 
 &pwr {
-- 
2.43.0

